#lang rhombus

// Not a `rhombus/hol` module at all.  Under the manifest design this could
// publish a `hol_manifest` submodule listing any theorem it liked, and an
// importer would admit it.  A published *state* cannot be fabricated: `Thm` is
// opaque, so there is nothing to write here that would pass.
export: hol_decls
def hol_decls = [["theorem", 'bogus', 'forall (n :: Nat): n === succ(n)', []]]
